              Given a scheduling _c_l_a_s_s and priority (_d_a_t_a),  this  macro  com‐
              bines  the  two  values to produce an _i_o_p_r_i_o value, which is re‐
              turned as the result of the macro.

       IIOOPPRRIIOO__PPRRIIOO__CCLLAASSSS((_m_a_s_k))
