              component,  that  is,  one  of  the  values IIOOPPRRIIOO__CCLLAASSSS__RRTT, IIOO‐‐
              PPRRIIOO__CCLLAASSSS__BBEE, or IIOOPPRRIIOO__CCLLAASSSS__IIDDLLEE.

       IIOOPPRRIIOO__PPRRIIOO__DDAATTAA((_m_a_s_k))
